  "question": {
    "text": "A pair of tangents are drawn from a point <math><mi>P</mi></math> to the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If the tangents make an intercept of <math><mn>2</mn></math> units on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the locus of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
